#. module: om_tally_connector
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_om_tally_connector
msgid ""
"Import from Tally, TallyPrime to Odoo, Tally migration: chart of accounts, "
"ledgers, parties, opening balances with open bills, vouchers, invoices, "
"stock items, godowns, opening stock"
msgstr ""

#. module: om_tally_connector
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_tally_connector
msgid ""
"Moves a Tally company into Odoo: upload the XML export of Tally or connect "
"to Tally directly, review the analysis, map groups, ledgers, parties and "
"stock items, check the trial balance, then import the opening balances or "
"the full voucher history. Installs the base, accounting and inventory parts "
"together."
msgstr ""

